Package: rattlerthis
Title: The 'rattler' Backend for 'condathis'
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R:
    person("Lucio", "Queiroz", , "luciorqueiroz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Solves, installs and activates 'Conda' environments in the R
    process through Rust bindings (using 'rextendr') to the 'rattler'
    library (<https://github.com/conda/rattler>), the engine that powers
    'pixi', without an external package manager binary. It is the
    "rattler" backend of 'condathis' and exports no functions: use the
    functions of 'condathis' with method = "rattler".
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/luciorq/rattlerthis
BugReports: https://github.com/luciorq/rattlerthis/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    cli,
    condathis (>= 0.2.0),
    fs,
    processx,
    rlang
Suggests:
    callr,
    jsonlite,
    parallel,
    ps,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Remotes:
    luciorq/condathis
Config/condathis/backend: rattler
Config/Needs/dev: devtools, pkgload, remotes, rcmdcheck, covr, testthat,
    usethis, pak, knitr, quarto, pkgdown, roxygen2, roxygen2md, lintr,
    styler, extendr/rextendr
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0.9000
Config/roxygen2/markdown: TRUE
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: GNU make, Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >=
    1.88.0, OpenSSL on Linux (libssl-dev / openssl-devel)
